# Synthetic demo data for Contoh Net Nusantara, a fictional RT/RW net. No real people, businesses or brands.
# Nothing is billed yet: flow subscription_billing makes the bills (one period per subscription per run) and
# subscription_dunning the statuses. LGN-00007 left before Rangka: its four months were billed elsewhere (billed_months).
